WEBVTT

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

02:28.731 --> 02:30.233
Mother…

02:36.489 --> 02:37.323
Mother?

02:52.797 --> 02:53.882
Master Jang!

03:05.727 --> 03:06.769
What's wrong?

03:08.021 --> 03:09.272
Are you badly hurt?

03:11.149 --> 03:12.525
Help me.

03:47.268 --> 03:48.853
Master Jang…

04:16.172 --> 04:17.257
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

04:46.202 --> 04:47.537
Master Jang.

05:07.807 --> 05:11.144
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN US AND THEM

05:11.227 --> 05:13.813
EPISODE 7
CHASE

05:13.896 --> 05:16.899
16 HOURS EARLIER

05:16.983 --> 05:19.777
The time allocated to us is ten minutes.

05:22.697 --> 05:24.949
We start moving at six o'clock sharp.

05:28.286 --> 05:30.621
Block all entryways to the military ward.

05:30.705 --> 05:31.706
Yes, sir!

05:39.297 --> 05:42.717
Everyone must get in the truck
within those ten minutes.

05:43.551 --> 05:45.970
What if we fail
to get everyone on board in time?

05:46.804 --> 05:47.638
What happens then?

05:47.722 --> 05:51.392
The truck will leave on time regardless.

05:56.105 --> 05:58.691
Are you all ready?

06:17.585 --> 06:18.628
Then,

06:20.004 --> 06:21.214
let's begin.

06:43.486 --> 06:44.570
Careful.

06:55.748 --> 06:57.458
Let's have the women go first.

07:03.423 --> 07:04.590
Climb up.

07:06.926 --> 07:07.802
Hold on to it.

07:09.554 --> 07:10.430
Hold on tight.

07:12.807 --> 07:13.891
You can do this.

07:31.159 --> 07:32.160
Slowly.

07:42.503 --> 07:45.339
They have stolen our uniforms
in an attempt to escape.

07:45.423 --> 07:48.926
Search and find anyone
who looks suspicious or unfamiliar.

07:49.010 --> 07:50.344
Yes, sir!

07:55.016 --> 07:56.017
What about this area?

07:57.477 --> 07:58.936
Has it already been searched?

07:59.896 --> 08:02.607
No, three soldiers went in to search
a short while ago.

08:06.402 --> 08:08.988
Then why don't I see any lights?

08:17.580 --> 08:18.915
You need to hurry!

08:19.499 --> 08:22.627
If you don't move fast,
we might all die here.

08:22.710 --> 08:23.753
Go on!

08:26.339 --> 08:27.590
Slowly.

08:27.673 --> 08:28.674
Grab it.

08:32.512 --> 08:33.429
Slowly.

08:49.153 --> 08:50.571
Why aren't you getting in line?

08:52.281 --> 08:53.449
I'm standing guard.

08:53.533 --> 08:55.076
Women go first, remember?

08:55.159 --> 08:56.994
I thought I made myself clear.

08:58.371 --> 08:59.789
I take care of my own business.

08:59.872 --> 09:04.001
Yes, you made yourself very clear,
but you need to listen to me right now.

09:04.085 --> 09:05.002
Get in line.

09:09.715 --> 09:11.133
Do you have feelings for me?

09:21.561 --> 09:24.897
Why would you ask such a random thing?

09:26.482 --> 09:28.067
In the middle of this?

09:28.150 --> 09:29.151
If you don't,

09:29.235 --> 09:32.113
I refuse any unnecessary concerns
you have for me.

09:42.665 --> 09:43.499
Careful!

09:45.751 --> 09:46.711
Be careful!

09:47.587 --> 09:48.921
Shit!

09:59.599 --> 10:02.518
You have to move your truck quickly!

10:02.602 --> 10:04.103
- Right now!
- Okay!

10:21.746 --> 10:23.289
We have to move. Now!

10:32.256 --> 10:33.090
Hurry!

10:33.966 --> 10:35.635
- Let's move!
- Go on, hurry!

10:36.802 --> 10:38.095
Just a bit more.

10:41.474 --> 10:43.684
There you go. Slowly.

10:54.403 --> 10:57.281
They're on the second floor.
Move your asses!

11:05.498 --> 11:07.124
Faster now!

11:07.208 --> 11:08.209
Yes, sir!

11:24.266 --> 11:25.434
What do we do now?

11:26.268 --> 11:27.937
They're onto us because of me!

11:28.020 --> 11:29.522
Don't blame yourself.

11:29.605 --> 11:31.357
It's not your fault.

11:32.441 --> 11:34.735
They're going to swarm this place
any minute now.

11:35.236 --> 11:36.487
We're all going to die.

11:36.570 --> 11:37.947
No one's going to die.

11:38.864 --> 11:42.660
We'll all be getting out of here,
so pull it together and hang in there.

11:52.378 --> 11:53.629
You should head down.

11:53.713 --> 11:55.464
I'll hold them off on my own.

11:56.841 --> 11:58.467
Are you trying to be the hero?

11:58.551 --> 12:00.052
I'm just trying to buy some time.

12:00.678 --> 12:04.098
No. Let's deal with them quickly
and go down together.

12:04.682 --> 12:06.976
Aren't we on the same side?

12:07.059 --> 12:09.228
Why do you argue with everything I say?

12:09.311 --> 12:11.564
We can be on the same side
and still disagree.

12:13.149 --> 12:15.818
If we can't share
different opinions freely,

12:16.444 --> 12:18.320
we'll no longer be on the same side.

12:19.697 --> 12:20.698
Wouldn't you agree?

12:42.970 --> 12:44.138
I'll help too.

12:46.182 --> 12:49.435
Let's save our bullets
and fire only when we have a clear shot.

13:19.381 --> 13:21.217
Do not spare a single one of them!

13:21.300 --> 13:22.343
Yes, sir!

13:22.426 --> 13:23.594
Attack!

14:01.632 --> 14:04.885
What exactly is going on
in this hospital right now?

14:07.721 --> 14:10.724
Are you sure it has nothing to do
with the serial disappearance?

14:11.308 --> 14:14.395
Do you really wish to know
the truth about this hospital?

14:16.355 --> 14:19.817
If so, you'll have to get permission
from the Governor-General first,

14:20.609 --> 14:24.947
or you can return home
and ask Lady Maeda yourself.

14:27.575 --> 14:28.993
What do you mean by that?

14:30.619 --> 14:34.415
I mean that no outsiders
should be allowed to find out

14:34.498 --> 14:36.709
what goes on in here.

14:37.459 --> 14:40.838
And not a single Josenjing
that has set foot in this place

14:40.921 --> 14:44.091
gets to walk out of here alive.

14:45.009 --> 14:48.345
That is all I can tell you.

14:50.180 --> 14:53.601
Even if that person
is someone I've been searching for?

14:57.855 --> 14:59.273
There will be no exceptions.

15:10.492 --> 15:12.244
Hold your fire!

15:19.251 --> 15:20.085
Move forward.

15:42.566 --> 15:44.151
Persistent bastards!

15:49.114 --> 15:49.949
Are you hurt?

15:53.285 --> 15:54.578
It's just a graze.

15:55.204 --> 15:56.288
Are you all right?

15:57.539 --> 15:58.540
I'm fine.

16:01.168 --> 16:02.378
What about you?

16:12.346 --> 16:13.263
Can you get up?

16:13.347 --> 16:14.515
Try to stand up.

16:19.019 --> 16:21.063
You said you wanted to meet your mother.

16:21.689 --> 16:23.023
So let's get out of here.

16:23.857 --> 16:25.734
Stay with me, please!

16:45.212 --> 16:47.047
Please remember me.

16:54.013 --> 16:55.472
My name is…

16:57.641 --> 16:59.435
Choi Yeong-gwan.

17:02.021 --> 17:03.355
And my address…

17:04.898 --> 17:06.775
It's 9 Sangwangsimni-jeong…

17:18.370 --> 17:19.580
Tell my mother…

17:22.791 --> 17:23.792
that I miss her.

17:26.754 --> 17:27.796
Please.

17:32.301 --> 17:33.510
Let's escape together.

17:35.804 --> 17:36.972
We can do it.

17:37.890 --> 17:40.350
We promised to leave together, remember?

17:41.560 --> 17:43.937
So, please… Please!

17:44.813 --> 17:45.647
Please!

18:06.210 --> 18:07.419
Don't blame yourself.

18:09.213 --> 18:10.547
It's not your fault.

18:11.965 --> 18:13.842
He didn't deserve this.

18:19.264 --> 18:20.557
Neither did my mother.

18:26.897 --> 18:30.025
Nor did all those people
who were kept in that underground prison.

18:33.112 --> 18:34.655
But why…

18:36.782 --> 18:38.242
Just why…

18:47.876 --> 18:49.837
Come on. We should go.

18:51.213 --> 18:53.132
Let's say we make it out alive.

18:56.718 --> 18:59.138
Is there such a thing as hope
waiting for us?

18:59.638 --> 19:00.639
Well…

19:02.766 --> 19:04.268
I don't know about hope,

19:05.561 --> 19:09.273
but I don't plan on going down
without a fight.

19:13.360 --> 19:14.528
You see,

19:15.737 --> 19:17.990
I'm going to survive as long as I can.

19:19.783 --> 19:20.951
I'm going to live

19:22.870 --> 19:26.540
to give them
an endless, irritating headache,

19:28.250 --> 19:29.960
to make their lives uncomfortable…

19:32.421 --> 19:33.797
and to be a living reminder

19:35.424 --> 19:37.092
of the things they did to us.

19:39.511 --> 19:40.429
I will never

19:42.097 --> 19:44.183
make it easy for them to kill me.

19:51.440 --> 19:54.234
Everyone made it down.
You should get moving as well.

19:57.362 --> 20:00.240
Let's retreat and get out of here.

20:13.295 --> 20:15.214
There is no more time to delay!

20:16.298 --> 20:19.426
March in at once
and kill every Josenjing inside!

20:19.509 --> 20:21.136
- Yes, sir!
- Wait.

20:31.897 --> 20:33.440
Here. Step up.

20:53.835 --> 20:55.087
I'll see you at the bottom.

21:30.205 --> 21:31.623
Would you like to go first?

21:36.545 --> 21:37.462
What's the matter?

21:40.090 --> 21:43.343
I'm afraid one of us has to stay behind.

21:45.804 --> 21:46.972
What do you mean?

21:47.055 --> 21:51.310
The director wants all the Josenjings
to be captured alive.

21:51.393 --> 21:52.978
Captured alive?

21:54.521 --> 21:56.440
We've already lost six of our men!

21:56.523 --> 21:58.608
An order is an order,
First Sergeant Haneda!

22:02.446 --> 22:04.281
Kill them all. We spare none!

22:04.364 --> 22:05.741
Capture them alive!

22:56.958 --> 22:57.876
What was that?

22:59.002 --> 23:00.921
What just happened?
What about Master Jang?

23:01.004 --> 23:02.672
He's not coming down.

23:05.425 --> 23:07.010
One of us has to stay behind?

23:07.094 --> 23:09.638
Until the truck leaves
Ongseong Hospital safely,

23:09.721 --> 23:12.391
someone has to stay behind
and divert their attention.

23:13.225 --> 23:14.059
Are you…

23:14.142 --> 23:16.853
Once you get down,
leave this place at once.

23:18.730 --> 23:23.068
I don't know how long I can hold them off,
but I'll try my best to buy you time.

23:28.448 --> 23:30.325
We aren't leaving him behind.

23:30.867 --> 23:31.827
It's his decision!

23:31.910 --> 23:32.828
Move.

23:34.329 --> 23:36.081
You're wasting time. Get in the truck!

23:36.164 --> 23:37.249
I said move!

23:37.332 --> 23:38.417
Look at those people!

23:40.127 --> 23:41.795
Are you trying to get them killed?

23:55.267 --> 23:56.184
Chae-ok.

24:15.704 --> 24:16.830
Mr. Gu.

24:18.707 --> 24:22.127
No matter what happens,
you must leave on time.

24:23.795 --> 24:26.256
Even if some haven't gotten on the truck,

24:26.339 --> 24:28.383
and even if that's Master Jang,

24:29.718 --> 24:31.011
you must not delay.

24:32.053 --> 24:32.971
Do you understand?

24:34.264 --> 24:36.475
God damn it!

25:38.912 --> 25:42.958
I'll take full responsibility.
Get in there now and kill them all!

25:43.458 --> 25:44.834
Listen, Sergeant Haneda--

25:45.961 --> 25:48.421
I'll report to Director Ichiro myself.

25:52.801 --> 25:55.512
What are you waiting for? Move now!

25:55.595 --> 25:56.513
Yes, sir!

26:32.507 --> 26:33.717
Damn it!

29:06.661 --> 29:07.495
Yes, sir.

29:16.296 --> 29:18.214
- Go.
- Yes, sir.

30:02.884 --> 30:04.469
Search every corner!

30:05.011 --> 30:07.263
Find whatever you can!

30:56.563 --> 30:58.398
He went that way!

31:00.525 --> 31:03.111
He seems to be heading to Area N
on the west side, sir.

31:54.120 --> 31:56.039
I'm certain of its authenticity.

31:56.122 --> 31:59.667
This porcelain was crafted
in the late 18th century

31:59.751 --> 32:02.921
during the reign
of King Jeongjo of Joseon.

32:12.096 --> 32:13.014
Yes.

32:16.601 --> 32:17.602
Are you sure?

32:20.688 --> 32:23.441
All right, then. I will.

32:29.948 --> 32:31.741
They're taking quite a while, sir.

32:40.416 --> 32:42.043
Sir!

32:55.515 --> 32:56.516
Young Master!

32:57.141 --> 32:58.226
Sir!

33:00.979 --> 33:01.896
I'm sorry!

33:02.480 --> 33:04.399
- Don't kill me!
- Sir…

33:04.482 --> 33:06.859
Please have mercy. Please don't kill me!

33:06.943 --> 33:07.944
It's all right now.

33:08.027 --> 33:09.404
Please forgive me.

33:09.487 --> 33:10.530
You're safe now.

33:10.613 --> 33:12.740
I beg you. Please spare me.

33:12.824 --> 33:15.994
Have mercy on me. Please don't kill me.

33:16.786 --> 33:18.329
Please have mercy…

33:18.413 --> 33:19.831
Don't kill me!

33:24.544 --> 33:25.545
Let's go.

34:03.041 --> 34:04.625
Mr. Ishikawa?

34:08.963 --> 34:10.131
Mr. Ishikawa!

34:37.075 --> 34:38.826
Thank you, Mr. Ishikawa.

34:38.910 --> 34:41.120
I knew you would come to save me.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.164
Are you hurt?

34:47.293 --> 34:48.795
Our child is fine too.

34:49.378 --> 34:50.505
First,

34:51.380 --> 34:52.590
you should bathe.

35:00.723 --> 35:02.183
Please forgive me, sir!

35:03.309 --> 35:07.814
But when I got here,
the woman was already gone!

35:08.898 --> 35:10.608
She was already gone?

35:11.484 --> 35:13.528
Then why are you locked in there?

35:14.112 --> 35:15.530
I'm terribly sorry, sir!

35:17.824 --> 35:20.118
Sir, Mr. Soma is behind this.

35:20.827 --> 35:21.744
What?

35:28.251 --> 35:29.252
That's right, sir!

35:29.335 --> 35:31.379
I'm certain it was Mr. Soma.

35:32.797 --> 35:33.714
Mr. Soma?

35:35.049 --> 35:36.050
Mr. Soma!

35:36.551 --> 35:38.970
Help me, Mr. Soma!

35:46.853 --> 35:47.687
Mr. Soma!

35:50.690 --> 35:52.900
Soma, that prick.

35:55.486 --> 35:56.404
Wait.

35:56.487 --> 35:57.780
What is it?

35:59.490 --> 36:00.658
Did you drink…

36:02.910 --> 36:04.579
the water in this cup?

36:05.246 --> 36:07.582
No. I didn't drink it, sir.

36:07.665 --> 36:09.333
I was tied up all this time.

36:09.417 --> 36:10.418
Then

36:11.794 --> 36:12.879
who drank it?

36:12.962 --> 36:14.046
Well,

36:15.339 --> 36:16.841
I'm not certain of that.

36:17.800 --> 36:18.968
Lieutenant Colonel Kato.

36:19.051 --> 36:22.013
I don't think you understand
the gravity of the situation.

36:26.142 --> 36:29.604
It doesn't matter
who drank the water in this cup.

36:29.687 --> 36:32.356
All the test subjects
in our underground prison are gone.

36:33.357 --> 36:37.028
They're all gone, including the girl
who Lady Maeda entrusted to us!

36:37.778 --> 36:38.613
Do you understand?

36:45.620 --> 36:48.664
Go and look
for that son of a bitch Soma right now!

36:49.582 --> 36:51.584
Return to the barracks and stand by.

36:51.667 --> 36:52.668
Yes, sir!

36:55.755 --> 36:57.423
- You.
- Yes, sir!

36:57.506 --> 37:00.218
Who else did you say
had entered this room?

37:01.052 --> 37:02.136
Well…

37:04.222 --> 37:05.473
Take off your clothes.

37:13.981 --> 37:15.942
It was those four people, sir.

37:19.237 --> 37:20.238
I see.

37:21.572 --> 37:22.657
All right. You may go.

37:34.961 --> 37:36.045
Could this mean

37:37.546 --> 37:39.507
that one of those four…

37:41.926 --> 37:43.636
drank from this cup?

38:27.430 --> 38:28.848
At long last,

38:30.349 --> 38:31.767
I got you!

39:17.688 --> 39:20.524
I don't think
they're going to let us go easily.

39:42.546 --> 39:43.923
Out of the way!

40:02.566 --> 40:03.984
- Don't lose them!
- Yes, sir!

41:00.833 --> 41:03.836
Attention, everyone!
Take as much as you want!

41:03.919 --> 41:07.631
Master Jang of Golden Treasure
is treating everyone in Bonjeong!

41:09.800 --> 41:11.135
Come, people.

41:12.011 --> 41:13.429
- Is it free?
- Just for tonight.

41:13.512 --> 41:14.930
Have as much as you want.

41:15.723 --> 41:16.724
Everyone, this way!

41:16.807 --> 41:17.725
Over here!

41:17.808 --> 41:20.519
Beer is on the house today!
Have as much as you want!

41:20.603 --> 41:22.688
Drink up. Come this way!

41:37.119 --> 41:38.287
Damn it!

41:40.748 --> 41:42.082
Back up quickly.

41:42.166 --> 41:43.584
We'll take the side road.

41:43.667 --> 41:44.502
Hurry!

41:55.387 --> 41:57.556
Move! Get out of the way!

41:57.640 --> 41:59.934
Goodness! My apologies, Officer!

42:02.478 --> 42:04.146
Step on it! Come on!

42:07.107 --> 42:09.568
We have to catch them
before they leave Bonjeong.

42:09.652 --> 42:10.736
- Go!
- Yes, sir!

42:51.652 --> 42:52.486
Get out.

42:52.570 --> 42:53.571
What?

42:53.654 --> 42:56.740
I… I don't understand…

42:56.824 --> 42:57.950
Get out!

42:58.033 --> 43:00.953
Oh my, I didn't know
you spoke the Joseon tongue.

43:01.036 --> 43:02.997
Sure, of course.

43:12.131 --> 43:13.215
Who's in the truck?

43:13.299 --> 43:15.467
What on Earth are you talking about?

43:16.552 --> 43:17.720
No one's in it.

43:18.596 --> 43:21.515
After I dropped off Myeong-ja,
no one else got in.

43:21.599 --> 43:22.600
I'm telling the truth!

43:23.183 --> 43:24.268
Is that right?

43:31.942 --> 43:34.612
Officer! What is the meaning of this?

43:42.369 --> 43:43.704
How did this happen?!

43:44.496 --> 43:46.081
Where did they all go?

43:47.416 --> 43:50.669
Where are all the Josenjings
you smuggled out of Ongseong Hospital?

43:56.634 --> 43:58.218
I already told you.

43:59.762 --> 44:01.847
No one but Myeong-ja got in the truck.

44:03.557 --> 44:05.809
Akiko was the only one
Mr. Ishikawa wanted.

44:06.977 --> 44:09.063
We returned Myeong-ja to him as promised.

44:10.064 --> 44:11.690
That is all. Happy now?

44:28.457 --> 44:29.583
Get changed!

44:32.086 --> 44:33.712
Drink all you want!

44:37.549 --> 44:39.677
Goodness! My apologies, Officer!

45:06.912 --> 45:07.830
Easy now.

45:20.175 --> 45:22.511
We have to catch them
before they leave Bonjeong.

45:22.594 --> 45:23.637
- Go!
- Yes, sir!

45:44.408 --> 45:46.827
You have all come a long way.

45:47.745 --> 45:50.164
I'm afraid we don't have time
for introductions.

45:50.247 --> 45:51.665
Hurry along for now.

45:52.458 --> 45:54.126
Let's hurry. Go.

45:59.089 --> 46:00.591
Let's go. Come on.

46:03.594 --> 46:04.428
Are you

46:05.929 --> 46:07.723
from the House of Golden Treasure?

46:10.768 --> 46:12.144
Unfortunately,

46:13.312 --> 46:15.230
Master Jang did not make it out with us.

46:17.733 --> 46:20.360
I wish you a safe trip.

46:20.444 --> 46:22.321
Let me ask one thing.

46:24.782 --> 46:26.033
Was all of this

46:27.951 --> 46:29.953
part of his plan from the start?

46:31.538 --> 46:33.457
You must not know it yet,

46:33.540 --> 46:37.169
but you must go through Master Jang
if you want anything in Bonjeong.

46:37.252 --> 46:40.172
Be it money, property, people,
or someone's life,

46:40.923 --> 46:43.091
Master Jang has a hand in everything.

46:43.967 --> 46:47.805
That is what he really does
as the owner of Golden Treasure.

46:58.023 --> 46:59.191
Arrest this man!

47:04.738 --> 47:06.782
Search the streets of Bonjeong.

47:07.574 --> 47:09.910
Arrest anyone
who seems even remotely suspicious!

47:09.993 --> 47:11.328
Get to work!

47:11.411 --> 47:12.412
Yes, sir!

47:29.346 --> 47:30.347
Clean everything up!

49:23.627 --> 49:26.630
Until the cherry blossoms fall.

49:37.474 --> 49:38.809
Could he still be alive?

50:24.730 --> 50:27.774
Master Ishikawa has just sent a message.

50:27.858 --> 50:31.778
He will not be returning home tonight.

51:30.378 --> 51:32.214
My apologies, Lady Maeda.

51:33.006 --> 51:34.841
I am deeply ashamed.

51:35.509 --> 51:40.430
I have already given you
enough chances, Director.

51:41.890 --> 51:44.726
You asked for a hospital,
so I built one for you.

51:44.810 --> 51:49.231
You wanted to experiment,
so I spared no expense in my support.

51:49.940 --> 51:53.652
Ma'am, I will rectify this situation
no matter what it takes.

51:53.735 --> 51:54.986
And by what means?

51:55.862 --> 51:59.199
How do you plan on recapturing
the test subjects that escaped?

52:00.492 --> 52:02.828
What about Akiko,
who has dropped out of sight?

52:04.496 --> 52:06.832
How do you intend to find them all?

52:08.250 --> 52:10.210
I'll come up with a plan right away.

52:10.877 --> 52:13.797
If you could give me some time,
I'll take responsibility--

52:13.880 --> 52:15.006
Please step down.

52:18.635 --> 52:25.058
That is the one and only way you can
take responsibility for this incident.

52:32.190 --> 52:36.111
We have had success
in a significant experiment recently.

52:44.744 --> 52:49.040
We have created an organism
that is on another level.

52:49.124 --> 52:54.045
It will not only change the medical world,
but perhaps also human history itself.

52:54.129 --> 52:57.757
I assure you,
you won't be disappointed this time.

52:58.341 --> 53:00.594
Please give me another chance,

53:01.469 --> 53:02.470
Lady Maeda.

53:50.393 --> 53:51.811
Yes, that's right.

53:52.395 --> 53:56.149
It's the Josenjing woman
you asked me to take special care of

53:57.025 --> 53:58.443
all those years ago.

54:27.722 --> 54:31.309
The specimen has been sedated
and locked in a cage for now.

54:31.393 --> 54:33.478
Should we keep releasing the nitrogen?

54:36.606 --> 54:37.440
Colonel Kato?

54:39.276 --> 54:40.277
Who could it be?

54:41.278 --> 54:43.196
The one that drank from the cup.

55:04.342 --> 55:06.136
Hurry! Get in!

56:03.443 --> 56:04.444
I wonder,

56:05.528 --> 56:09.199
who's the one that swallowed the Najin?
